    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-1 is-size-3-mobile is-uppercase">Liberty Mutual</p>
    <p class="projectdescription is-size-5">
We spoke to people from all walks of life, all across the country. But mostly, we listened. The result was a wealth of compelling information in a less-than-compelling format. When it came time to share what we learned with the client, we wanted the delivery to be as unique as the story itself.
<br><br>
The solution was an interactive book that blended illustration, animation, code, and design. From the outside, it looked like a traditional book, but through the lens of an iPad mini, illustrations came to life and charts sprang from the page in 3D. My role focused on the book’s layout and the 3D illustrations that transformed raw data into an engaging, immersive story.
    <br>
    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-4">Collaborators:</p>
    <p class="collabnames is-family-secondary has-text-weight-bold is-size-4 is-italic">James Adame // Wes Dorsainvil // Nat Wales</p>
